# Customer Segmentation using Machine Learning

## Project Overview
This project groups customers based on their annual income and spending score using the K-Means Clustering algorithm.

The objective is to identify different customer groups and understand their spending behavior.

## Project Objectives
- Understand unsupervised learning.
- Analyze customer data.
- Apply K-Means clustering.
- Group customers based on similarities.
- Visualize customer segments.
- Predict the cluster of a new customer using user input.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Scikit-learn

## Machine Learning Algorithm
**K-Means Clustering**

K-Means is an unsupervised Machine Learning algorithm used to group similar data points into clusters.

## Dataset Description

| Column | Description |
|---|---|
| CustomerID | Unique customer ID |
| Annual_Income | Annual customer income |
| Spending_Score | Customer spending score |

